  les_title:'Why this app exists',
  les_mod:'Welcome to Your Brain',
  les_goals:['Understand why this platform was created','Understand why so many young people feel overwhelmed, distracted, or behind','See why understanding your brain makes life feel less confusing'],
  les_note_title:'Lesson Notes',
  les_note:'<p>You did not download this app because life is going perfectly. Maybe you feel overwhelmed, distracted, or like you are always one step behind. Maybe you question why you react the way you do, why certain things hit hard, or why motivation disappears right when you need it most.<\/p><p>Here is the thing: <strong>none of that makes you broken.<\/strong> It makes you human - with a brain that was never handed an instruction manual.<\/p><p>This platform exists to be that manual. Not a textbook. Not a lecture. A clear, honest guide to how your mind actually works - so instead of fighting yourself, you start understanding yourself.<\/p><p>When you understand the brain, life becomes less confusing. Emotions make more sense. Habits feel less random. Other people become more readable. And most importantly, you stop blaming yourself for things that have a perfectly good explanation.<\/p><h3 style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--blu);margin:20px 0 12px;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase">Quick Notes<\/h3><ul style="padding-left:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>This app exists to explain how your mind works in a practical way<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>Many struggles are understandable brain and behavior patterns<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>Modern life overloads attention, emotions, and motivation<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>Understanding is not making excuses; it is gaining leverage<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>Self-blame hides patterns, but awareness reveals them<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>Real progress starts with clarity<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--vio);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x2022;<\/span>The app works best when lessons are applied, not just watched<\/li><\/ul><h3 style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--red);margin:20px 0 12px;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase">Common Mistakes<\/h3><ul style="padding-left:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--red);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F;<\/span>Treating every struggle like proof of a bad personality<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--red);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F;<\/span>Consuming self-help content without applying anything<\/li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55"><span style="color:var(--red);font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F;<\/span>Expecting instant transformation instead of gradual progress<\/li><\/ul>',
  les_terms:[['Self-awareness','Noticing what you think, feel, and do without instantly judging it.'],['Pattern','Something your mind or behavior does again and again in similar situations.'],['Overload','When your brain has too much input, pressure, or information to handle well.'],['Leverage','Something that gives you more power to change a situation.']],
