    {q:'True or False: Understanding yourself means making excuses and doing nothing.',os:['True - awareness leads to passivity','False - understanding helps you act better, not avoid action','True - self-knowledge replaces effort','False - but only for some people'],a:1,e:'Understanding is not an excuse. It is leverage. Clarity about what is happening makes better action possible.'}
